  "reviewed_from_revision": "900a677fb6481a259d1e24073d9dc1aacf785507",
  "review_note": "FO-03 partial successor: exact-boot fsynced stop/fence admission, Node-owned work, one remembered shutdown signal and signed physical closure after actual Node/engine joins. Final source passed 400 native Raft cases across 13 targets, 158 Raft units, 12 RPC, four startup and 19 admin cases. The separately audited pre-coalescing source tree passed 93 legacy Node cases. Physical closure is not terminal removal or capacity readiness; standalone Raft stop transport, Finalizing resumption, fresh terminal checks, atomic terminal receipt/slot release and fleet controller work remain pending. Deployed RustFS/Colima, TPS/p99 and soak are unqualified."
}
